{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">&quot;The English version was released on May 15.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25bcThis game was localized from Japanese. If you would like to enjoy the game in Japanese, please select Japanese from the settings below.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Steam Library -&gt; Properties -&gt; General -&gt; Language</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25bcStory</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Faced with the brink of extinction due to a sudden environmental catastrophe, humanity placed its last hope in a team of android explorers, sent into the depths of space.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Aboard one of these vessels, a single android has traveled alone through the cosmos for twenty long years.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">At last, it arrives on an uncharted planet\u2014but what awaits it there is unknown...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Gameplay is <strong>choice-based</strong>, but there are <strong>no multiple endings</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There are <strong>no restrictions on streaming or content creation</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Estimated playtime:</strong> 60\u201390 minutes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Decision","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3665680/970fa68c1b4d902ff97f3734bcb5f93ed17b1203.jpg"}],"total":1},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3665680?t=1747665926","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3665680?t=1747665926","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665680/ae33be2c514c066fee5a36d67cfcf178132fa334/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1747665926","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665680/ae33be2c514c066fee5a36d